# Google Services (e.g. APIs or Firebase)
# CO CHU DICH giu dong duoi day o dang comment => google-services.json VAN duoc commit.
# Ly do: file nay bat buoc phai co thi plugin com.google.gms.google-services moi build
# duoc, va noi dung cua no (API key Android, project id, app id) la CONG KHAI theo
# thiet ke cua Google — no chi dinh danh project, khong cap quyen. Phong thu that nam
# o Firestore Rules + App Check + restrict API key theo package name/SHA-1.
# ⚠️ KHAC HOAN TOAN voi service account key (*-adminsdk-*.json) — loai do la khoa
#    toan quyen, bi chan o duoi va o .gitignore goc repo.
# google-services.json

